--- !u!114 &2060682053
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 2060682051}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: f4688fdb7df04437aeb418b961361dc5, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  m_Material: {fileID: 0}
  m_Color: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
  m_RaycastTarget: 1
  m_RaycastPadding: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0, w: 0}
  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "1. \u6211\u559C\u6B22\u8FD9\u4E2A\u89E6\u89C9\u53CD\u9988\uFF0CI prefer
    this haptic feedback.\n    \u5B8C\u5168\u4E0D\u540C\u610F                                                                 
    \u5B8C\u5168\u540C\u610F\n\uFF08Strongly Disagree\uFF09                                          
    \uFF08Strongly Agree\uFF09  \n       1             2            3            
    4             5             6             7   \n2.\u6211\u8BA4\u4E3A\u6211\u7684\u89E6\u89C9\u611F\u53D7\u5339\u914D\u6211\u7684\u52A8\u4F5C\uFF0C
    I feel that this haptic feedback matches my motions.\n    \u5B8C\u5168\u4E0D\u540C\u610F                                                                 
    \u5B8C\u5168\u540C\u610F\n\uFF08Strongly Disagree\uFF09                                          
    \uFF08Strongly Agree\uFF09  \n       1             2            3            
    4             5             6             7\n3.\u8BE5\u89E6\u89C9\u53CD\u9988\u8BA9\u6211\u611F\u89C9\u7403\u662F\u771F\u5B9E\u5B58\u5728\u7684\uFF0CThe
    haptic feedback gave me a sense that the ball was actually there.\n    \u5B8C\u5168\u4E0D\u540C\u610F                                                                 
    \u5B8C\u5168\u540C\u610F\n\uFF08Strongly Disagree\uFF09                                          
    \uFF08Strongly Agree\uFF09  \n       1             2            3            
    4             5             6             7\n4.\u521A\u624D\u5728\u865A\u62DF\u73B0\u5B9E\u4E2D\u4F53\u9A8C\u7684\u88AB\u6392\u7403\u51FB\u4E2D\u7684\u89E6\u611F\u4E0E\u73B0\u5B9E\u4E16\u754C\u4E2D\u76F8\u4F3C\uFF0C
    The tactile feel of being hit by the volleyball in VR was similar to that in
    the real world.\n    \u5B8C\u5168\u4E0D\u540C\u610F                                                                 
    \u5B8C\u5168\u540C\u610F\n\uFF08Strongly Disagree\uFF09                                          
    \uFF08Strongly Agree\uFF09  \n       1             2            3            
    4             5             6             7"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e8aa822fe5bd38d4aa0fc4316703423d, type: 2}
